                "retweet_count": 179,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Last night, a callous, dangerous, and partisan bill passed with solely Republican support \u2014 and they did it while Americans were asleep, hoping no one would notice.\u00a0\n\nI am outraged and disgusted. I cannot fathom how extreme Republicans can sleep soundly after rubber stamping the largest cuts to basic needs programs for healthcare and hunger in my lifetime. (1/6)",
